 {"candidate_origins": [], "decision": "revise", "kind": "review", "packet_id": "001-6d7bb960-1", "reason": "Packet 001-6d7bb960-1 is current, matches the first unchecked todo, and its matching ready_for_review result records 18 focused tests passing with exit 0. The implementation correctly reads participation from Club aggregate state, but the tests do not prove authoritative current group participation when the GroupMembership projection is stale, as required by the packet and ADR 0025. The only stale-projection test stops MembershipProjector and removes the person from the club, so resolution exits with member_not_active before active_group_member? is evaluated. Add a focused test that keeps the person active in the club, stops GroupMembershipProjector, commits removal from the custom group, verifies the projected group membership remains active, and asserts the resolver returns active_group_member?: false; then rerun the packet's focused validation.", "recorded_at": 1790526998, "reviewed_head": "f19fbef257ff9f78db586404d35d0ac46f911a33", "schema_version": 1, "task": "- [ ] 001 Add and focused-test a narrow Membership public authoritative resolver for an active same-club person and target custom group, returning membership identity plus server-owned club/person/group facts and current group participation while rejecting invalid IDs, missing/cross-club/built-in groups, and inactive memberships.", "task_id": "001", "worker_result": "ready_for_review"}
